DexArena PI0.5 LoRA integration

The masked flow-matching implementation in algo/pi05.py is adapted from
openpi/src/openpi/models/pi0.py in DexJoCo commit
8d23b0fab23b17a58c4b55f3942e17013aaf8267, derived from Physical Intelligence OpenPI.
DexArena adds per-timestep and per-channel loss masking, named absolute-joint
interfaces, 32-to-58-dimensional action projections, and asynchronous execution.

